<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian October unemployment 4.1 pct - official.</title>
<headline>Austrian October unemployment 4.1 pct - official.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Social Affairs Ministry reported the following economic indicator details on Tuesday.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN UNEMPLOYMENT	October    September    Oct 1995</p>
<p> Percentage of workforce	4.1	  4.1	    4.7</p>
<p> Total			    214,293    191,867	204,122</p>
<p>NOTE - The October and September 1996 figures were calculated by the European Statistics Office and are based on a 1995 census. The October 1995 figure was calculated by the Austrian Social Affairs Ministry based on a 1994 census and is not directly comparable.</p>
<p>Since December 1995, Austria has calculated percentage of workforce according to EU standards and all previous figures were calculated according to OECD standards.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
